                "html": "<div class=\"tap-breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <span>›</span> <span>The atelier</span></div><span class=\"tap-eyebrow\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:16px\">— Est. 2014 · Brisighella, Italy</span><h1 class=\"tap-h1\" style=\"max-width:1100px\">Two musicians went to Istanbul<br>looking for <em>one oud</em>.<br>Eleven years later, this is what came of it.</h1>"
