              "id": "tap_ab_story_r_html",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-atelier-r\"><span class=\"tap-eyebrow\">— Our story</span><h2 class=\"tap-section-title\">A workshop, a network,<br>and a shipping desk.</h2><p class=\"tap-lead\">Tapadum opened in a converted barn in Brisighella in 2014. Eleven years later, we work with 26 master luthiers across Turkey, Iran, Egypt and Italy. We've delivered nearly 2,500 hand-tuned instruments to musicians in 47 countries.</p><p class=\"tap-lead\">We do three things, and we try to do them well: meet the makers, set up the instruments, and ship them out so they arrive playable.</p></div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tap_ab_timeline",
      "elType": "section",
      "settings": {
        "background_background": "classic",
        "background_color": "#1A1612",
        "padding": { "unit": "px", "top": "100", "right": "32", "bottom": "100", "left": "32", "isLinked": false },
